{"title":"Career Roadmap: Natural Farming Consultant","role":"Natural Farming Consultant","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Natural Farming / Vertical Farming / Hydroponics · Target Career: Natural Farming Consultant","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Natural Farming / Vertical Farming / Hydroponics"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Natural Farming Consultant helps farmers shift to natural and organic farming - using local inputs like jeevamrit, mulching and crop diversity - cutting costs and chemicals while keeping yields."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Natural Farming Consultant does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Train farmers in natural-farming practices"},{"text":"Design farm transition plans"},{"text":"Help with certification (PGS-India, NPOP)"},{"text":"Link farmers to buyers of natural produce"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government natural-farming missions"},{"text":"NGOs and FPOs"},{"text":"Organic food companies"},{"text":"Own consultancy"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Field Trainer"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Consultant"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Senior Consultant"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Programme Lead"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Own consultancy"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agronomy and soil science"},{"text":"Visit natural and organic farms"},{"text":"Learn soil biology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Natural farming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Organic and natural farming practices"},{"text":"Learn on-farm inputs"},{"text":"Learn the National Mission on Natural Farming"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intern with an NGO or FPO doing natural farming"},{"text":"Run a demonstration plot"},{"text":"Learn PGS-India certification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Consult"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RAWE / ELP with natural-farming farmers"},{"text":"Document results with data"},{"text":"Apply or start consulting"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Natural-farming practices"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Soil health"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Certification"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Market linkage"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Farmer trust"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Patience"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Soil-test kits"},{"text":"Field records"},{"text":"WhatsApp groups"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Natural-farming NGOs"},{"text":"FPOs"},{"text":"Organic food companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Natural / organic farming training (e.g. NCONF, MANAGE)"},{"text":"PGS-India awareness"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"